```
id: SPL-011
name: Conditional Access policy changed
description: Conditional Access policy created, updated or deleted.
platform: Splunk
mitre_tactic: Defense Evasion
mitre_technique: T1556.009 Modify Authentication Process: Conditional Access Policies
severity: High
data_source: index=azure (audit logs)
false_positives: Planned policy maintenance.
tuning: Maintain a lookup of approved actors; suppress report-only changes if desired.
test_method: Disable and re-enable a test policy in a lab tenant.
owner: <OWNER>
status: Draft
last_review: 2026-11-19
```
index=azure sourcetype="mscs:azure:eventhub" category=AuditLogs operationName="*conditional access policy" earliest=-1h
| eval actor=coalesce('properties.initiatedBy.user.userPrincipalName','properties.initiatedBy.app.displayName')
| eval policy='properties.targetResources{}.displayName'
| eval severity=if(like(operationName,"Delete%"),"high","medium")
| table _time operationName policy actor severity
| sort - _time
